<title>UK: UK's Brunel wins Asia Pulp order.</title>
<headline>UK's Brunel wins Asia Pulp order.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>British engineering group Brunel Holdings Plc said on Wednesday that its subsidiary, Cameron Equipment Ltd, has won a 13 million stg order from the Asia Pulp &amp; Paper Co Ltd.</p>
<p>The contract is to supply slitter rewinders and re-reelers to Asia Pulp.</p>
<p>&quot;We have every expectation of major contracts for similar machines in South East Asia in the course of the next year,&quot; said Brunel chief executive Cliff Walker.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
